3. Benchmarks and knowledge bases used but NOT redistributed
================================================================================

These are not included in this repository. The builders under `datasets/` fetch
or prepare them from their own sources, under their own terms.

    WebNLG, REBEL, Wiki-NRE   relation-extraction benchmarks
    HotpotQA                  CC BY-SA 4.0 — deliberately not vendored, since its
                              share-alike does not sit under Apache-2.0
    MuSiQue                   CC BY 4.0
    Wikidata                  CC0 1.0
    DBpedia                   CC BY-SA 3.0 — queried for type constraints

The Vietnamese higher-education corpus behind the Edu-KG release is not
distributed here or anywhere: it is withheld under institutional terms. What is
released is the knowledge graph extracted from it, deposited separately under
CC-BY-4.0.
